{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "zn15_32_determine_lot_size",
  "spec": ["zones 7.2.1", "zones 15.30"],
  "description": "Conformance test 30 (DetermineLotSize, §7.2.1). Named zn15_32 because zn15_30 and zn15_31 already hold two extra SimpleParcellize vectors. The harness calls DetermineLotSize directly on the cropped rect {10, 10, 15, 13} (centre (12, 11)) with the scripted BDS, growth developers and lot configuration manager of §15 test 30: every desirability map has tract shift 2 (k = 16), and every developer answers EstimateDesirability only at (12, 11) (0 elsewhere) and logs each call, so the vector checks that every candidate is asked at (12, 11), in candidate order. Results are (width, depth, minDepth, maxDepth, block); every expected value is the one §15 test 30 states. The configurations are given to the manager in DESCENDING ID order (0x109 first), so the manager's own walk order is the reverse of the ascending-ID order FreeCity4 chooses for the set (§7.2.1 'Configuration order' [choice]); the tie of (e) therefore separates the two (a walk that kept the manager's order would visit 0x102 first and give (2, 3, 2, 4, 9)). cfg_refs is [id, AddRefs, Releases] per configuration touched since the last clear: the manager AddRefs each configuration of the set once and DetermineLotSize releases each once, and a configuration outside the set is never touched (it shows the set of each case). (a) Zone 1: R$ (40, 812) is taken first, R$$ replaces it (40 = 40, 950 > 812), R$$$ does not (39 < 40); stage walk 55 > 40 -> 4, 41 > 40 -> 3, 40 <= 40 stops: stage 3; set {0x101, 0x102, 0x103, 0x104, 0x107, 0x108} (0x105 has stage 4, 0x106 wealth 1, 0x109 purpose 3 only); scores 750 (0x101), 550 (0x102), 355 (0x103), 0x104/0x107 fail the size test, 0x108 has no object -> 0x103 (3, 3); widening with width 3 -> [1, 4]; block 3 * 3 -> (3, 3, 1, 4, 9). (b) Zone 2: block ftol(r24(3 * 2.5)) = 7 -> (3, 3, 1, 4, 7). (c) Zone 5 (shallow): CS$ -> CS$$ (12 > 10) -> CS$$$ (12, 400 > 300) -> CO$$ (13 > 12); CO$$$ does not (250 not > 250); stage 20 > 13 -> 2, list ends: stage 2; set {0x103, 0x107, 0x108, 0x109}; 0x103 fails the shallow test, 0x109 scores 110 -> (2, 2); [2, 2] adjusted to [1, 3]; purpose 3, density 2 -> 6 -> (2, 2, 1, 3, 6). (d) Zone 4: 0x103 counts B7 only, v 160, score 90 < 110 -> (3, 3); widening -> [1, 3]; density 1 -> 7 -> (3, 3, 1, 3, 7). With CO$$'s lists invalid: stage 1, 0x103 leaves the set, 0x109 is chosen -> (2, 2, 1, 3, 7). (e) [choice] (a) with demands 99.9 (R$) and 300.0 (R$$): bestDemand 300, scores 100 (0x101), 100 (0x102), 295 (0x103); FreeCity4 takes the lower ID 0x101 -> (2, 2); widening with width 2 -> [2, 4]; block 6 -> (2, 2, 2, 4, 6). (f) Zone 7: no candidates, no BDS or manager call -> (2, 2, 1, 3, 5). (g) The pure functions: v(k, n, avg) = ftol(r24(r24(k / n) * avg)), the depth adjustment and the residential density-2 block.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "zone_env", "cells": [64, 64]},
    {"op": "zone_create", "session": 0, "manager": false},
    {"op": "zone_init"},

    {"op": "zone_building", "id": "0xB001", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 2, "capacity": 40},
    {"op": "zone_building", "id": "0xB002", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 2, "capacity": 60},
    {"op": "zone_building", "id": "0xB003", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 1, "capacity": 500},
    {"op": "zone_building", "id": "0xB004", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 2, "capacity": 150},
    {"op": "zone_building", "id": "0xB005", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 2, "capacity": 300},
    {"op": "zone_building", "id": "0xB006", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 2, "capacity": 371},
    {"op": "zone_building", "id": "0xB007", "purpose": 3, "wealth": 2, "capacity": 90},
    {"op": "zone_building", "id": "0xB008", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 2, "capacity": 356},
    {"op": "zone_building", "id": "0xB009", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 2, "capacity": 237},
    {"op": "zone_family", "id": "0xF001", "types": ["0xB001", "0xB002", "0xB003"]},
    {"op": "zone_family", "id": "0xF002", "types": ["0xB005", "0xB006", "0xB007"]},

    {"op": "zone_cfg", "id": "0x109", "w": 2, "h": 2, "purposes": [3], "wealths": [2], "stage": 1, "object": ["0xB007"]},
    {"op": "zone_cfg", "id": "0x108", "w": 3, "h": 2, "purposes": [1, 3], "wealths": [2], "stage": 1, "object": null},
    {"op": "zone_cfg", "id": "0x107", "w": 3, "h": 1, "purposes": [1, 3], "wealths": [2], "stage": 1, "object": ["0xB005"]},
    {"op": "zone_cfg", "id": "0x106", "w": 2, "h": 2, "purposes": [1], "wealths": [1], "stage": 1, "object": ["0xB009"]},
    {"op": "zone_cfg", "id": "0x105", "w": 2, "h": 3, "purposes": [1], "wealths": [2], "stage": 4, "object": ["0xB008"]},
    {"op": "zone_cfg", "id": "0x104", "w": 1, "h": 4, "purposes": [1], "wealths": [2], "stage": 1, "object": ["0xB001"]},
    {"op": "zone_cfg", "id": "0x103", "w": 3, "h": 3, "purposes": [1, 3], "wealths": [2], "stage": 2, "object": ["0xF002"]},
    {"op": "zone_cfg", "id": "0x102", "w": 2, "h": 3, "purposes": [1, 3], "wealths": [2], "stage": 3, "object": ["0xB004", "0xB007"]},
    {"op": "zone_cfg", "id": "0x101", "w": 2, "h": 2, "purposes": [1], "wealths": [2], "stage": 1, "object": ["0xF001"]},

    {"op": "zone_dev", "token": "0x2001", "type": "0x1010", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 1, "shift": 2, "estimate": [[12, 11, 40]], "demand": 812.9, "growth": []},
    {"op": "zone_dev", "token": "0x2002", "type": "0x1020", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 2, "shift": 2, "estimate": [[12, 11, 40]], "demand": 950.5,
     "growth": [[3, 2, 4], [1, 1, 3], [0, 0, 1]], "desir_value": [[3, 2, 55], [1, 1, 41], [0, 0, 40]]},
    {"op": "zone_dev", "token": "0x2003", "type": "0x1030", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 3, "shift": 2, "estimate": [[12, 11, 39]], "demand": 5000.0, "growth": []},
    {"op": "zone_dev", "token": "0x2004", "type": "0x3110", "purpose": 2, "wealth": 1, "shift": 2, "estimate": [[12, 11, 10]], "demand": 100.0, "growth": []},
    {"op": "zone_dev", "token": "0x2005", "type": "0x3120", "purpose": 2, "wealth": 2, "shift": 2, "estimate": [[12, 11, 12]], "demand": 300.9, "growth": []},
    {"op": "zone_dev", "token": "0x2006", "type": "0x3130", "purpose": 2, "wealth": 3, "shift": 2, "estimate": [[12, 11, 12]], "demand": 400.0, "growth": []},
    {"op": "zone_dev", "token": "0x2007", "type": "0x3320", "purpose": 3, "wealth": 2, "shift": 2, "estimate": [[12, 11, 13]], "demand": 250.0,
     "growth": [[0, 0, 2]], "desir_value": [[0, 0, 20]]},
    {"op": "zone_dev", "token": "0x2008", "type": "0x3330", "purpose": 3, "wealth": 3, "shift": 2, "estimate": [[12, 11, 13]], "demand": 250.7, "growth": []},

    {"op": "zone_clear_events", "note": "(a) zone 1"},
    {"op": "zone_determine_lot_size", "region": {"rect": [10, 10, 15, 13]}, "type": 1,
     "expect": {"width": 3, "depth": 3, "min_depth": 1, "max_depth": 4, "block": 9}},
    {"op": "zone_expect", "state": {"cfg_refs": [["0x101", 1, 1], ["0x102", 1, 1], ["0x103", 1, 1], ["0x104", 1, 1], ["0x107", 1, 1], ["0x108", 1, 1]]}},
    {"op": "zone_expect_log", "filter": {"event": "estimate_desirability"}, "events": [
      {"dev": "0x2001", "x": 12, "z": 11},
      {"dev": "0x2002", "x": 12, "z": 11},
      {"dev": "0x2003", "x": 12, "z": 11}
    ]},

    {"op": "zone_clear_events", "note": "(b) zone 2"},
    {"op": "zone_determine_lot_size", "region": {"rect": [10, 10, 15, 13]}, "type": 2,
     "expect": {"width": 3, "depth": 3, "min_depth": 1, "max_depth": 4, "block": 7}},

    {"op": "zone_clear_events", "note": "(c) zone 5, shallow"},
    {"op": "zone_determine_lot_size", "region": {"rect": [10, 10, 15, 13]}, "type": 5,
     "expect": {"width": 2, "depth": 2, "min_depth": 1, "max_depth": 3, "block": 6}},
    {"op": "zone_expect", "state": {"cfg_refs": [["0x103", 1, 1], ["0x107", 1, 1], ["0x108", 1, 1], ["0x109", 1, 1]]}},
    {"op": "zone_expect_log", "filter": {"event": "estimate_desirability"}, "events": [
      {"dev": "0x2004", "x": 12, "z": 11},
      {"dev": "0x2005", "x": 12, "z": 11},
      {"dev": "0x2006", "x": 12, "z": 11},
      {"dev": "0x2007", "x": 12, "z": 11},
      {"dev": "0x2008", "x": 12, "z": 11}
    ]},

    {"op": "zone_clear_events", "note": "(d) zone 4"},
    {"op": "zone_determine_lot_size", "region": {"rect": [10, 10, 15, 13]}, "type": 4,
     "expect": {"width": 3, "depth": 3, "min_depth": 1, "max_depth": 3, "block": 7}},
    {"op": "zone_expect", "state": {"cfg_refs": [["0x103", 1, 1], ["0x107", 1, 1], ["0x108", 1, 1], ["0x109", 1, 1]]}},

    {"op": "zone_dev", "token": "0x2007", "type": "0x3320", "purpose": 3, "wealth": 2, "shift": 2, "estimate": [[12, 11, 13]], "demand": 250.0,
     "note": "(d) with CO$$'s growth/decline lists invalid (no growth list)"},
    {"op": "zone_clear_events"},
    {"op": "zone_determine_lot_size", "region": {"rect": [10, 10, 15, 13]}, "type": 4,
     "expect": {"width": 2, "depth": 2, "min_depth": 1, "max_depth": 3, "block": 7}},
    {"op": "zone_expect", "state": {"cfg_refs": [["0x107", 1, 1], ["0x108", 1, 1], ["0x109", 1, 1]]}},

    {"op": "zone_dev", "token": "0x2001", "type": "0x1010", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 1, "shift": 2, "estimate": [[12, 11, 40]], "demand": 99.9, "growth": [],
     "note": "(e) the tie: (a) with demands 99.9 (R$) and 300.0 (R$$)"},
    {"op": "zone_dev", "token": "0x2002", "type": "0x1020", "purpose": 1, "wealth": 2, "shift": 2, "estimate": [[12, 11, 40]], "demand": 300.0,
     "growth": [[3, 2, 4], [1, 1, 3], [0, 0, 1]], "desir_value": [[3, 2, 55], [1, 1, 41], [0, 0, 40]]},
    {"op": "zone_clear_events"},
    {"op": "zone_determine_lot_size", "region": {"rect": [10, 10, 15, 13]}, "type": 1,
     "expect": {"width": 2, "depth": 2, "min_depth": 2, "max_depth": 4, "block": 6}},
    {"op": "zone_expect", "state": {"cfg_refs": [["0x101", 1, 1], ["0x102", 1, 1], ["0x103", 1, 1], ["0x104", 1, 1], ["0x107", 1, 1], ["0x108", 1, 1]]}},

    {"op": "zone_clear_events", "note": "(f) zone 7: no candidates, no BDS or manager call"},
    {"op": "zone_determine_lot_size", "region": {"rect": [10, 10, 15, 13]}, "type": 7,
     "expect": {"width": 2, "depth": 2, "min_depth": 1, "max_depth": 3, "block": 5}},
    {"op": "zone_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "bds_developer"}, "count": 0},
    {"op": "zone_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "lot_configurations"}, "count": 0},
